    fix(tests): tolerate namespace-degraded hosts in wrapper verdict-hardening run assertions (INT-CI-001)
    
    CI run 35733081762 (commit 455f865): 4 TestWrapperVerdictHardening tests fail on GitHub runners because the wrapper exits 2 at the namespace preflight (unshare exit 1) before warn-mode commands can run. Guard the run-assertions with a bare-launch probe (rc=2 + degraded marker), mirroring the proven test_standalone_cli pattern; warn semantics (loud warning, never a block) still asserted on every host. test_normal_allow_verdict_unchanged missed by the in-flight fix completed. Local: 1336 passed / 4 skipped.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
